Sval: the OS media controls show no position for a private tab

MediaStatusManager withholds a private tab's title, artist, artwork and
address from the system's media controls, and still handed them the
media's duration and position, which mark what is playing. A private tab
reports no position state, neither the one its page sets through
navigator.mediaSession nor the one guessed from its media element.

